Captures are mandatory — and the longest chain wins the move.

5
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,618
A man that reaches the far row becomes a flying king.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,766
Four computer levels, from gentle Companion to deep Hard.

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,950
Two players on one screen, or a phone joins on the local network.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,400
Hints, undo, autosave and a family record. International Draughts.
